    "svarakshit_how_to_use_T9k7EF": {
      "type": "svarakshit-how-to-use",
      "blocks": {
        "step_99WJix": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Charge & Power On",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M21 10.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v2.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125H21M4.5 10.5h6.75V15H4.5v-4.5zM3.75 18h15A2.25 2.25 0 0021 15.75v-6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25h-15A2.25 2.25 0 001.5 9.75v6A2.25 2.25 0 003.75 18z\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>Insert 2 AAA batteries into the battery compartment at the base of the device. Press and hold the red power button for 2 seconds to switch on. The LCD display will light up and show a startup sequence.</p>",
            "pill_text": "Tip: Charge once a week for regular household use"
          }
        },
        "step_9w4Gmz": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wait for Sensor Warmup (30 Seconds)",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>After powering on, wait 30 seconds for the electrochemical sensor to reach operating temperature. The display will show dashes or a countdown. Do NOT start testing until the warmup is complete — early readings may be inaccurate. The device will beep once when ready.</p>",
            "pill_text": "Important: Do not skip the warmup phase"
          }
        },
        "step_pdtCpk": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scan Near Gas Points",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>Hold the device by the grip and move the silver metal sensor tip to within <strong>5–10 cm</strong> of potential leak points. Move slowly — about 5 cm per second — to give the sensor time to respond. Check these key areas in order:</p><ul><li>LPG cylinder valve &amp; pressure regulator</li><li>Rubber pipe connections at both ends</li><li>Gas burner nozzles and knobs</li><li>Gas geyser pipe connections</li><li>PNG meter and pipe joints</li></ul>",
            "pill_text": "Keep sensor tip 5–10 cm from surface for best accuracy"
          }
        },
        "step_63NCYy": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Read the LCD Display",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 12V5.25\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>The LCD continuously shows the ambient gas concentration level and temperature. Watch for changes as you move the sensor:</p><ul><li><strong>Normal reading</strong> — Low numbers, no alarm. Area is safe.</li><li><strong>Rising numbers</strong> — Approaching a gas source. Slow down and probe carefully.</li><li><strong>\"Hi\" on display + loud beep</strong> — Gas leak detected at this point!</li></ul>",
            "pill_text": "The display also shows temperature — useful for kitchen safety checks"
          }
        },
        "step_RgN3Xw": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "If Leak Detected — Act Immediately",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>If the device shows <strong>\"Hi\"</strong> and alarms:</p><ul><li><strong>DON'T panic</strong> — stay calm</li><li><strong>Turn OFF</strong> the gas cylinder valve or main PNG valve immediately</li><li><strong>Open ALL windows & doors</strong> — ventilate the area</li><li><strong>Do NOT use</strong> electrical switches, lighters, phones near the area</li><li><strong>Evacuate</strong> everyone from the room</li><li><strong>Call your gas agency</strong> and a licensed plumber for inspection</li></ul>",
            "pill_text": "Emergency: Call 1906 (LPG) or 101 (Fire)"
          }
        },
        "step_PDCcheck": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Self PDC — Check Every New Cylinder",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>",
            "description": "<p>Use Swarakshit to perform a quick <strong>Self Pre-Delivery Check (PDC)</strong> every time you:</p><ul><li><strong>Change your LPG cylinder</strong> — scan the new cylinder valve, regulator, and rubber pipe connections right after fitting</li><li><strong>Receive a new full cylinder</strong> — verify that the fresh cylinder has no leak before connecting it to your stove</li></ul><p>A 60-second self PDC after every cylinder change can prevent the most common cause of kitchen gas accidents.</p>",
            "pill_text": "Tip: Self PDC takes under 60 seconds — make it a habit"
          }
        }
      },
